OL,3,GNEWSABergerac director finds Jersey a
OL,4,Areal revelation
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the filming of the third series of
OL,7,FBergerac is under way, the director and
OL,8,Fa local crew member consider the
OL,9,Fimportant part Jersey plays in the TV
OL,10,Fshow.
OL,12,FThe first time director Paul Wilmhurst
OL,13,Fvisited Jersey was to look for filming
OL,14,Flocations and he said it had been "a
OL,15,Freal revelation".
OL,17,FHe said: "It feels very friendly,
OL,18,Frelaxed, it's like England but not
OL,19,FEngland, as there's this slight sort of
OL,20,FFrench continental vibe, but it's not
OL,21,Ftoo heavy, and I'm loving that and
OL,22,Floving being here.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
