OL,3,GNEWSABergerac director finds Jersey a
OL,4,Areal revelation
OL,5,
OL,6,F"There's something ironic really
OL,7,Fbecause I was reading about the crime
OL,8,Fstatistics here and there aren't a lot
OL,9,Fof murders in Jersey, they don't really
OL,10,Fhappen.
